00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:52.600
There's no need for these things to happen
in the country, right?

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:57.620
This is one of the richest countries in the
world as inspirational as we can say, the

00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:05.280
12 year olds actions are, or as notable as
the resolve of seven year old Jimmy is, uh,

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:10.340
in order to raise money for his mom's cancer
treatment or whatever it is, a thousand times

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:13.719
more disgusting that it's necessary in our
country.

00:02:13.719 --> 00:02:14.719
This is optional.

00:02:14.719 --> 00:02:18.969
Like if we decided as a country, we're not
going to be allowed in a way that allows this,

00:02:18.969 --> 00:02:22.230
we're not going to be organized in a way that
